(* CHECK-DAG: alias_errors.pia:[[@LINE+4]]:{{[0-9]+}}: error: 'least' is already a name in this file, so it cannot also name the module 'Algo.Order'
   CHECK-DAG: alias_errors.pia:[[@LINE+3]]:{{[0-9]+}}: error: the interface 'Algo.Order.Ord' has no 'largest'
   CHECK-DAG: alias_errors.pia:[[@LINE+2]]:{{[0-9]+}}: error: importing 'compare' unqualified would shadow a name this file binds; use 'Algo.Order.compare' instead (ADR 0022)
